      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْلَاطٌ</span></b>  One <i>who makes mistakes,</i> or <i>commits
errors, much,</i> or <i>frequently;</i> expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِيرُ الغَلَطِ</span>;
(K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غلَّاطٌ</span></b>  (TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَلُوطٌ</span></b> . (O in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غلت</span>.)

